Package: geomorphR
Type: Package
Title: Geometric Features for Building Footprints in Sf Objects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Cohen", email = "cohen.jota@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Jonathan Cohen [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jonathan Cohen <cohen.jota@gmail.com>
Description: Extracts reproducible geometric and urban-morphology descriptors from polygon and multipolygon building footprints stored as sf objects. Methods include area, perimeter, compactness, shape, bounding-box, topology, convexity, and orientation measures, together with optional building-height, floor-count, gross-floor-area, floor-space-index, coverage, volume, and floor-height metrics derived from explicitly named attribute columns. The resulting sf objects preserve the source attributes and geometry for spatial analysis, visualization, and downstream statistical or machine-learning workflows, with optional future-based parallel processing for larger datasets.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MakiJota/geomorphR
BugReports: https://github.com/MakiJota/geomorphR/issues
